          "title": "You'll want to know: நெடுஞ்சாலை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நெடுஞ்சாலை — neṭuñcālai — \"a highway\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நெடுஞ்சாலையில் கார்கள் வேகமாகப் போகின்றன. neṭuñcālaiyil kārkaḷ vēkamākap pōkiṉṟaṉa. Cars go fast on the highway."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நெடும், long, + சாலை, road: the ம் becomes ஞ் before ச."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நெடுஞ்சாலை (neṭuñcālai) is built from neṭu, \"long\" (DEDR 3738), and சாலை, \"road\" (DEDR 2471): the long road."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
